    "name": "Tile Tales Builder",
    "steam_appid": 3677420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build with logic, discover affinities, and relax as you plan your perfect village.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist building game with puzzle and strategy elements, every decision matters. On a grid-based map, you must place buildings wisely, taking their affinities into account. Houses near fields? Great. Monuments next to forests? Maybe not the best idea...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple rules and a clean look, the game offers a calm experience\u2014perfect for those seeking something relaxing yet challenging. No ticking clock. No pressure. Just you, the map, and your ability to plan and adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjacency logic</strong>: each building has positive and negative affinities with others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle meets strategy</strong>: think before placing, and maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and minimalist style</strong>: play at your own pace with a clean interface and soothing visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring system</strong>: challenge yourself and find the most efficient layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and continue later</strong>: build your village gradually, no rush.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy logic games, building, and a good dose of tranquility, this is the perfect game for you. Get ready to place tiles, explore combinations, and create something beautiful and functional\u2014one block at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build with logic, discover affinities, and relax as you plan your perfect village.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist building game with puzzle and strategy elements, every decision matters. On a grid-based map, you must place buildings wisely, taking their affinities into account. Houses near fields? Great. Monuments next to forests? Maybe not the best idea...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple rules and a clean look, the game offers a calm experience\u2014perfect for those seeking something relaxing yet challenging. No ticking clock. No pressure. Just you, the map, and your ability to plan and adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjacency logic</strong>: each building has positive and negative affinities with others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle meets strategy</strong>: think before placing, and maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and minimalist style</strong>: play at your own pace with a clean interface and soothing visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring system</strong>: challenge yourself and find the most efficient layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and continue later</strong>: build your village gradually, no rush.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy logic games, building, and a good dose of tranquility, this is the perfect game for you. Get ready to place tiles, explore combinations, and create something beautiful and functional\u2014one block at a time.</p>",
    "short_description": "Build your village tile by tile in a relaxing game that blends puzzles with strategy. Carefully place each building to maximize your score based on the map's affinities. Simple, calming, and addictive.",
